  "_note": "uv sync --extra aigamestore: the vendored aigamestore-gym env (vendor/aigamestore), which needs a Chromium browser (system Chrome by default). Lock-stepped: fps must equal 60 / frame_skip (10 with the default frame_skip 6). Three.js + canvas HUD.",
  "_levels_note": "An episode is one level: it ends on a win, a loss or a level clear, and reset() restarts the same level. Levels 1..7 are listed, one phase each; drop or reorder them as the session needs.",
